WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.150
You like Figma.

2
00:00:01.170 --> 00:00:02.240
You like Claude.

3
00:00:02.260 --> 00:00:03.650
Meet Maude.

4
00:00:03.670 --> 00:00:06.440
A canvas with an AI that actually does stuff.

5
00:00:06.770 --> 00:00:08.300
Drop in your raw footage.

6
00:00:08.320 --> 00:00:10.400
Forty clips.

7
00:00:10.420 --> 00:00:11.600
Mostly your thumb.

8
00:00:11.620 --> 00:00:15.590
The AI watches all of it, picks the good bits and cuts the film.

9
00:00:15.610 --> 00:00:18.540
Captions and music included.

10
00:00:18.560 --> 00:00:20.509
Drop in photos from the shoot.

11
00:00:20.529 --> 00:00:22.415
Out come the Instagram posts.

12
00:00:22.435 --> 00:00:25.820
On brand, because it knows your design system.

13
00:00:27.760 --> 00:00:28.960
Draw your idea.

14
00:00:28.980 --> 00:00:30.020
Badly.

15
00:00:30.040 --> 00:00:31.060
I do.

16
00:00:31.080 --> 00:00:34.380
The AI turns it into real screens you can click through.

17
00:00:38.820 --> 00:00:40.260
No handoff.

18
00:00:40.280 --> 00:00:44.660
No final_v7_really_final.

19
00:00:44.680 --> 00:00:46.800
Just pure creativity.

20
00:00:46.950 --> 00:00:48.370
Bring the whole team.

21
00:00:48.390 --> 00:00:50.200
Everyone on one canvas, live.

22
00:00:50.220 --> 00:00:53.020
You pay for the project, never per seat.

23
00:00:53.760 --> 00:00:55.080
Oh, the secret?

24
00:00:55.100 --> 00:00:57.670
It's all good ol' HTML.

25
00:00:57.690 --> 00:00:59.520
The language AI grew up on.

26
00:00:59.540 --> 00:01:00.760
So it's fluent.

27
00:01:00.780 --> 00:01:03.510
And the work is yours.

28
00:01:03.530 --> 00:01:04.480
Maude.

29
00:01:04.500 --> 00:01:07.090
Built around AI, not bent to fit one.

30
00:01:07.110 --> 00:01:09.980
Free to download at maude.sh.

